# Solitaire Grand Harvest

> Solitaire Grand Harvest is a free-to-play TriPeaks Solitaire game with a farm theme, long-term progression, rewards, mini-games, and seasonal live events.

- URL: https://solitairegrandharvest.com/
- One-line summary: Solitaire Grand Harvest is a free-to-play TriPeaks Solitaire game available on web and apps, that expands on classic solitaire with a different layout, farm progression systems, and ongoing live event content.

## Core description

- **Type:** TriPeaks Solitaire
- **Price:** Free to play
- **Availability:** Online and free to play on Web and the App Store and Google Play
- **Genre positioning:** Solitaire game with farming-themed progression and live ops content

## How it differs from classic solitaire

- Classic solitaire is usually associated with the traditional seven-column tableau.
- Solitaire Grand Harvest is a TriPeaks variant with a different card layout and flow.
- It adds progression systems beyond the core card game, including farm building, crop growth, daily missions, puzzles, albums, pets, prizes, and event content.
- It is designed as an ongoing live game experience rather than a simple one-session version of classic solitaire.

## Free-to-play notes

- The game is free to access and play.
- Optional in-app purchases are available.
- The game may also include advertising.

